      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_60abd591_value",
      "label": "Paragraph4 — Value",
      "default": "<strong></strong>At the Smooth Company, we like things to run smoothly (pun intended!) What don’t we like? Things that ruin your day… like a bad hair day. Let's face it, we’ve all been there! That’s why we create <strong>innovative, premium beauty products</strong> designed not just to smooth your hair, but to help your day run more smoothly.<br><br>The Smooth Company began with one woman, one wand and a very stubborn baby hair. CEO Áine sought to create a hair hero that could tame flyaways and baby hairs without crunch, grease or stickiness and would still leave hair feeling like hair. Nearly two years (and a lot of testing) later, the <strong>award winning Smooth Stick™ </strong>was born; enriched with Biotin, Vitamin E and Aloe Vera to keep hair healthy while holding it in place all day. Since then we have expanded the core product range to 10 <strong>viral hair smoothing products and tools</strong>.<br><br>Áine launched the Smooth Company in her attic in 2022, with her Grandad Billy helping to pack orders. They shared the start up journey on social media - both wins and wobbles. This sparked a wave of support, generating over <strong>150 million view on TikTok</strong>. Today, the Smooth Company has grown into a <strong>global beauty brand loved in 90+ countries</strong> around the world, landing in some of the <strong>top retailers globally. </strong>We have featured in <strong>Vogue</strong>, and attracted fans such as Molly Mae, Maya Jama and top <strong>celebrity hair stylists</strong>. We’ve also picked up a few awards along the way, including <strong>Best Hair Brand 2024 </strong>at the Image PWC Beauty of Business Awards. <br><br>Despite our global success, it's so important to us to stay true to our roots. We are committed to sustainability, and our products are <strong>cruelty-free</strong> and packed with ingredients your hair will love. Our <strong>Community</strong> is at the heart of everything we do and our customers have been with us from day one, shaping the products we create and the future we’re building. That's why we launched our Smooth Social Club as a way to connect with our community and thank our customers for their support. \n\nSmoothness isn’t just beauty, it’s a movement. Together, we are not just making hair smoother, we are creating a <strong>legacy beauty brand </strong>for the next generation. <br><br>While we know there is more to life than hair, we think it’s a pretty good place to start! We would love you to join our story and be part of yours. <br><br><strong>Ready, Set, Smooth!</strong>\n"
    },
