    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_fb417986_value",
      "label": "Paragraph4 — Value",
      "default": "<b>Founder, Director and Owner</b><br>Áine Kennedy, a young entrepreneur from Dublin. <br>She has a degree in Entrepreneurship from Maynooth University and over 6 years of experience in Brand Management and Marketing in the beauty industry. Her career began at age&nbsp;16, working in Boots, then Benefit Cosmetics. Most recently she competed in the presitgious EY Entrepreneur of the Year Programme and was awarded the title of EY Emerging Entrepreneur of the Year.&nbsp;<br>The Smooth Company is dedicated to her Nana Carmel, who always had a hair tip or trick up her sleeve. Family is important to Aine with her Grandad Billy featuring in many TikTok videos, and her sister Eimear helping to run the company. Together, they bring a personal and family-driven touch to The Smooth Company, connecting with it's growing community."
    },
